        },
        {
          "dimension": "Regulatory",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Bybit appears on the MAS investor alert list, restricts numerous jurisdictions, and its CEO acknowledged Chinese users need VPNs to access the exchange, signaling persistent licensing and compliance exposure.",
